@name     udp_emit
@alias    >u
@group    sys
@c_name   skode_clause_udp_emit_0
@type     immediate
@arity    0
@match    ()
@summary  emit formatted udp event
@doc
Emits UDP message formatted according to string buffer.
Usage: [event %g %g] >u
@code
    return skode_exec_gt_u(ctx, s, args, argc);
@end

